        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI 4750, Low Profile Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNew contemporary styled low profile deadbolt from AHI. Keyed outside with turn bolt inside. High quality stainless steel construction, <b>Grade 1</b> (best grade). It is available in single cylinder and double cylinder functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll the exterior components, including the deadbolt, thumb turn, screws and strike plates are stainless steel. Both the outside and inside housing plates are made from 1/2\" thick solid stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features:</b> of AHI 4750 Contemporary Stainless Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Security</li>\r\n<li>Material: Marine Grade 316 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Outside Projection: 1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Inside Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core</li>\r\n<li>Fit Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway</lI>\r\n<li>Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG4850-install.pdf?v=1691093355\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI 4750 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBoth the Satin Stainless Steel and the Polished Stainless Steel finishes are made out of 316 marine grade stainless steel.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Stainless Steel Deadbolt, AHI 4750",
                "description": "AHI 4750 Deadbolt - New contemporary styled low profile deadbolt from AHI. Keyed outside with turn bolt inside. High quality stainless steel construction, Grade 1 (best grade). It is available in single cylinder and double cylinder functions. \r\n",
